WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.188 --> 00:00:03.480
- Today, more than ever, I
feel like people just need

00:00:03.480 --> 00:00:04.829
a freaking hug.

00:00:04.829 --> 00:00:07.019
So, today, we're gonna
play Hug Telephone around

00:00:07.019 --> 00:00:08.629
the office at Buzz Feed,
where I'm gonna go find

00:00:08.629 --> 00:00:10.879
someone to hug, then they're
gonna go hug someone,

00:00:10.879 --> 00:00:12.809
and hug, and hug, and hug.

00:00:12.809 --> 00:00:15.392
(upbeat music)

00:00:29.701 --> 00:00:31.451
- Thanks for the hug.

00:00:36.865 --> 00:00:37.782
- Oh, okay!

00:01:39.225 --> 00:01:40.058
- Oh.

00:02:12.731 --> 00:02:13.573
(whooshing)

00:02:13.573 --> 00:02:15.159
(squeaking)

